## Task Service Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant TaskService
    participant Dispatcher
    participant Agent
    participant Storage

    Client->>API: POST /api/tasks
    API->>TaskService: create_task(req)
    
    TaskService->>TaskService: Validate
    
    TaskService->>Storage: insert_task()
    
    TaskService->>API: task_id
    
    API->>Client: 202 Accepted
    
    TaskService->>Dispatcher: dispatch(spec, work)
    Dispatcher->>Agent: execute()
    
    alt LLM Required
        Agent->>LLM: complete()
        LLM-->>Agent: result
    end
    
    Agent-->>Dispatcher: outcome
    Dispatcher-->>TaskService: result
    
    TaskService->>Storage: update_task()
    TaskService->>Storage: upsert_agent_stats()
```

