## Event Streaming Service

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant SSE
    participant Queue
    participant Producer

    Client->>SSE: GET /api/events/stream
    
    loop Every Event
        Producer->>Queue: put(event)
    end
    
    loop Stream
        SSE->>Queue: get() with timeout
        Queue-->>SSE: event
        SSE-->>Client: data: event
    end
    
    loop Heartbeat
        SSE-->>Client: data: heartbeat (30s)
    end
```

